# Model Traceability – BRFN Digital Marketplace

## 1. Purpose

The purpose of this document is to define traceability links between the i* Strategic Dependency and Strategic Rationale models, the BRFN strategic BPMN model, the operational BPMN models and the agreed requirements.

The aim is to link the stakeholders' goals and dependencies with the underlying business processes and operational activities providing the required functionalities.

## 2. Scope

The scope of this traceability includes:

- F1 – Product Listing and Validation
- F2 – Inventory and Seasonal Availability Management

## 3. Traceability Table

| Functionality | Actor Goal / Dependency | Strategic BPMN Subprocess | Operational BPMN Element | Requirement Reference |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| F1 | To be completed from i* models | To be confirmed | To be confirmed | F1 requirement |
| F2 | To be completed from i* models | To be confirmed | To be confirmed | F2 requirement |

